0 41879 is the short-legs part Essential uses for Leo. It carries
0 facing: -Z like 73200b, so the same half-turn about Y that faces a full
0 figure forward faces this one forward too. Short legs are 24 LDU from
0 hip to sole, not 40, so the torso sits 32 above a legs origin that is
0 itself only 24 above the plate.
0
0 The red tile is there for the same reason as in good-figure-holds-camera:
0 a figure is all decorative, so without one real clutch the plate itself
0 reports NO JOINT.
